e_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=838166#post838166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heyo, im back baby!<br /> <br /> i was pondering a lot about DtF today and i came up with another little homebrow as for Factions.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Shepherds of Eden.&quot; their symbol would be an Apple with wings protecting it.<br /> <br /> The idea of this faction is basically, demons who already accepted that God is gone and that the other factions might be too Heavy (considering that most of them are literally monsters in their intentions.) So, their goal is not to achieve redemption, but rather to protect Mankind. Maybe out of sheer love and will power trying to keep the apocalypse at bay, instead of Using humans for their own goals, they want to help humans to Inherit The Earth (See what i did there?)<br /> <br /> Their weakness would be mainly to be seen as the Weaken faction, and the fact that not many share this views on humanity, embracing the idea that Every human is beautiful by definition and that every human has a chance of redemption.<br /> <br /> In a way, they are proper Luciferians by believing and trying to save mindkind.<br /> <br /> im still thinking on a faction secret.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Devilutionary Path.&quot;<br /> <br /> Basically, these basterds are not looking to save humanity, or to redeem themselves or to become Earthbounds. They trully believe that the world needs to be &quot;Rebooted.&quot;, that &quot;God Trascended into machinery.&quot; their goals its to explore the lores and the technology..As well to Evolve mankind to the next level by Creating nephilims, Trying to turn humans into Demons etc.. basically, they are the Missguided insane ones who believe that God now lies in the machine. and that Spiritual Faith has weakened so much that the only faith one can have is in the technology, to implement it and to experiment in order to create a New Eden for what ever may survive The Armageddon.<br /> These take cues from the idea of human experimentation, noticing how powerful is the science in order to control the human population.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm getting some slight Technocracy vibes from them. (In a good way.) So do they use their &quot;alterations&quot; on themselves as well?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-03T06:56:02-08:00","id":841274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yaoi Huntress Earth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=841080#post841080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm getting some slight Technocracy vibes from them. (In a good way.) So do they use their &quot;alterations&quot; on themselves as well?</div> </div> </div> </div>yes. i would see them accepting that technology is the better way, even better than god. but in an incredible brutal/self harming way. nothing like the technocracy but more like merchandised horrors","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":1754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","user":"Crowley","date":". 03-03-2016, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-03T13:03:29-08:00","id":841458,"title":"","content":"Next stop: God-Machine.<br /> (Not really)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-03T20:10:32-08:00","id":841671,"title":"","content":"Pardon the bad English and grammar, aint my first language<br /> <br /> Apocalyptic Forms 101<br /> Or How to become Nightmare Fuel.<br /> <br /> Im starting to write down rules on how to create apocalyptic forms based on my homebrews.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> What is an Apocalyptic form?.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Hell Is Other People</i><br /> <br /> Its an extension of the Elohim's real nature which bleeds through the mortal carcass. It\u2019s the pain and anger, the self mutilation and cannibalism of the instinct of the angel who fell from grace.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> - I Love You. That\u2019s why I must hate you.<br /> \u201cThe Thing cannot be described - there is no language for such abysms of shrieking and immemorial lunacy, such eldritch contradictions of all matter, force, and cosmic order. A mountain walked or stumbled.\u201d<ul><li>H.P Lovecraft. The Call of Cthulhu</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Rule of thumb, the more torment the player has, the more nightmare fuelish it looks like..but should this always as a rule?. Personally, no. Its more, i think its more disturbing when it looks more sacred. Personally, i see that some of the manifestation's are related to the character's nature and demeanor. A Devil could easly have Wings that look torn and shredded...but for dramatic purpouse, if the character has a Nature/Demeanor of someone who (-in a way- brings hope, it would make sense that his wings are radiant and shining like the ones of angels. After all, one of the &quot;Devil's Tricks.&quot; its that he doesnt looks like a monster but like a beautiful angel.<br /> <br /> To me, angels are creatures so abstract and far from reach that they become Alien-Esque even. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://themonstermaven.files.wordpress.com/2014/01/cherubim_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://themonstermaven.files.wordpress.com/2014/01/cherubim_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://themonstermaven.files.wordpress.com/2014/01/cherubim_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://themonstermaven.files.wordpress.com/2014/01/cherubim_11.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/fe/0a/e0/fe0ae03960433f7acee0db6647d7fa51.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/fe/0a/e0/fe0ae03960433f7acee0db6647d7fa51.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/fe/0a/e0/fe0ae03960433f7acee0db6647d7fa51.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/fe/0a/e0/fe0ae03960433f7acee0db6647d7fa51.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://41.media.tumblr.com/8877be9f81dd86efa946b45914222683/tumblr_n0rjwadbcQ1qz5q5lo1_400.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://41.media.tumblr.com/8877be9f81dd86efa946b45914222683/tumblr_n0rjwadbcQ1qz5q5lo1_400.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://41.media.tumblr.com/8877be9f81dd86efa946b45914222683/tumblr_n0rjwadbcQ1qz5q5lo1_400.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> http://41.media.tumblr.com/8877be9f81dd86efa946b45914222683/tumblr_n0rjwadbcQ1qz5q5lo1_400.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/01c325ac8b50a1735595e18fe4d08a00/tumblr_n9ygrsO1NU1tu9py2o4_r2_500.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/01c325ac8b50a1735595e18fe4d08a00/tumblr_n9ygrsO1NU1tu9py2o4_r2_500.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/01c325ac8b50a1735595e18fe4d08a00/tumblr_n9ygrsO1NU1tu9py2o4_r2_500.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> http://40.media.tumblr.com/01c325ac8b50a1735595e18fe4d08a00/tumblr_n9ygrsO1NU1tu9py2o4_r2_500.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/2c/52/05/2c5205f58f2f98fa4e60f69793ace8e4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/2c/52/05/2c5205f58f2f98fa4e60f69793ace8e4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/2c/52/05/2c5205f58f2f98fa4e60f69793ace8e4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/2c/52/05/2c5205f58f2f98fa4e60f69793ace8e4.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Angels are horrying creatures made of nothing but loyalty and love. Asexual and wanting to do Her bidding.<br /> \u201cLove is the law, love under will.\u201d<br /> \u2015 <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/3948.Aleister_Crowley\" target=\"_blank\">Aleister Crowley</a>, <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/119060\" target=\"_blank\">The Book of the Law</a><br /> Theres nothing more terryfing that the things we do for Love, for feel special. To be able to feel something and for someone to correspond it. They dress us, address us and makes us feel part of a bigger thing. We are Whole.<br /> <br /> So, Whats the Anti-Love? How withered is the soul after not just being heart brokened but being tortured and shattered beyond comprehension? Will we still wear the same dresses we were given? Will we scream in rage, in blood, in putrid profanity against He/She/It who loves thy?.<br /> The Fallen ones are not only Hatred against Her, but sadness, sorrow, fear and self loathing. Some obsessed, some down with the stockholm\u2019s syndrome, some feeling themselves out of an abusive relation. To me, the demon\u2019s apocalyptic form its not only a manifestation of the horror that leaks through the human carcass, but a cry and a whimper of \u201c\u00bfWhy?\u201d.<br /> In my games I describe the act of turning inside out, of the angel ripping his own wings off and self mutilating in all his rage and hatred against himself, or against her. Like a little child who gets tossed away with out saying what or why. Like being abandoned by a loved one and never being mature enough to comprehend your condition.<br /> Love is a horrible thing, which makes us do terrible things.<br /> <br /> <br /> - 4 Good and 4 Bad.<br /> <br /> Usually the player has a grand total of 8 apocalyptic forms. theres two ways to use these when it comes to character creation and roleplay. One, give the player 4 basic ones or let him choose em. And through RP/Gaining torment. the player unlocks slowly other 4 based on his action and perceptions, as metaphors and symbolisms of how &quot;His Name Changed.&quot; through this experience<br /> <br /> The other way, it\u2019s the simple one. To let the player pick all 8 on his character creation and roll with it.<br /> <br /> -Dominion<br /> \u201cNearly all men can stand adversity, but if you want to test a man's character, give him power.\u201d<br /> \u2015 <a href=\"http://www.goodreads.com/author/show/229.Abraham_Lincoln\" target=\"_blank\">Abraham Lincoln</a><br /> <br /> In my games, i give something to the demons called or Dominion. To me, there\u2019s an connection between what the Elohim created to its creation.<br /> The dominion mainly depends only on the player and the angel\u2019s backstory.<br /> Days of Fire states that theres a place for every angel, and every angel for a place. And the book already states that angels were able to create everything that existed.<br /> The best way I can use to translate this concept is the idea of Spheres on Mage the ascension but a little bit more limited. Example<br /> Dominion one: you can sense things related to your original creation<br /> Dominion two: Atmosfear: causing a small manifestation of your will. Example.<br /> Liriel is a devil who collaborated in the creation of light as an electrical source. He may roll conscience at a difficulty of 7 to make lights turn off on a room, or a small electronic device. Nothing bigger than that. The difficulty is determinate by the GM based on how big or how much of a theatrical effect would it make as well the amount of witnesses and how much fear or creeped out are they<br /> Dominion three :Altering States: By rolling Conscience, the player might use his dices as bonifiers or penalizers related to the objective.<br /> Alastor, angel of vengeance is fighting a man who violently killed his fianc\u00e9e. He rolls in order to call upon a Reckoning on the assailant. He gets 2 successes. He decides to use both successes to increasing his damage by 2 lethal damage if He connects. He could also use it to give himself a lower dodging difficulty since he has a vengeance oath against his target.<br /> The player is only limited by how big and massive it is, the ST must keep in mind one sacred rule..Drama. im aware that combat wise this can be too op, so its up to the ST if he decides to use this sytem. I use it since some of my players are limited when it comes to Pacts due the difficulty of a demon using Light in order to create a pact with a mortal who\u2019s needs don\u2019t fit what the demon may offer.<br /> <br /> Creating Apocalyptic forms.<br /> If I can\u2019t inspire love, I will inspire fear!.<br /> Frankenstein\u2019s Monster, Mary Shelley.<br /> <br /> Creating apocalyptic forms is something that\u2019s been discussed a lot between players and ST\u2019s. so, im going to Try and make something more cohesive.<br /> The problem about apocalyptic forms is that it\u2019s a bit delicated when it comes to create them, since its pretty easy for them to be derailed by the players.<br /> So. Lets start by some basics.<br /> We will need the Player\u2019s guide as some sort of Walkthrough. Or for a basis.<br /> Can we use the core book? Sure, but I find it a bit limitated when it comes to options.<br /> <br /> First things first. In order to create an apocalyptic form we will need to answer some questions, some might lead to more questions that I haven\u2019t considered yet, this is good.<br /> Is it a General Form or a House Exclusive.<br /> Is it an apocalyptic form that Any demon may have or does it belong to a certain house?<br /> If it\u2019s a general or Common form. Does it exist already? Can be physically altered so it resembles what youre looking for?<br /> Example: Joe\u2019s character. Crowley is a Halaku heavily inspired by Spawn and Hellraiser. He wants Chains like tentacles coming from his body. So the ST suggest him to buy Extra limbs (3) and Claws/Teeths (1) so the chains have hooks in every end. System wise, it works as a Combo<br /> <br /> If its something you want exclusive to your house. Remember that houses can (Somehow) be divided by their Aspects or Stereotypes.<br /> Example: if we are dealing with a Slayer, he would usually see things related to death to pick as an apocalyptic form. Stealth, ghosts, shadows, silence or the grim reaper. James Character. Clarissiel wants his apocalyptic form to be something more intrusive. Having in mind the idea that the grim reaper has no obstacles, he talks it to the GM and creates the Apocalyptic Form \u201cDeath knows no Obstacles.\u201d Which allows him to phase through objects and surfaces. Since it\u2019s a pretty game breaking/changing apocalyptic form, the GM decides to add some weaknesses.<br /> Such as fire still being able to hit him and that he cant phase if theres crosses around the house, he may phase through vehicles or bullets by taking stunning damage instead of lethal damage and spending one point of faith in order to do so. The gm decides that the cost of such form should be 4. And to move through objects he will have to do a roll of Stamina + Athletics.<br /> <br /> To which skill is the apocalyptic form related to.<br /> Is it social?, is it for combat, is it for stealth, is for an element or concept (such as fire, light, water, death), is it biological or is it supernatural. By biological I mean, poisons or toxins, spines and scales. By supernatural I mean voices of the dead or seeing how long has someone before dying.<br /> <br /> With that being said, is it an area effect. Target effect, personal effect \u2013external or personal effect internal.<br /> By external is something that manifest out of the character (Wings for example). Internal is something that happends within the character and that human\u2019s cant see.<br /> <br /> Is it Humanoid, or Bestial like?<br /> Mainly for showing off, will the demon keep a humanoid visage or he will looks less and less human.<br /> <br /> is a torment related apocalyptic form or is neutral?<br /> When using it, will people have nightmare fuel or will it slowly be degraded as the permanent torment of the player\u2019s character increases.<br /> <br /> Can it be done through Lores?<br /> If you can, then why do you need the apocalyptic form? :P<br /> <br /> Costs.<br /> The smaller and more \u201csubtle\u201d it is the lesser the cost should be. The more spectacular and showing off it is, the highest. Area effects, shields, regeneration based on elements should cost 4 points. While things like fangs/claws, change eyes/hair colour, perception related, lashing tail or things should cost less (1).<br /> <br /> Limits of the Apocalyptic forms.<br /> They are only related to the demon the fallen mythos. So, no umbra, no arcadia, no mage or technocracy related.<br /> They are not related to technology or modernity. These are ancient forms which happened to be useful in today\u2019s modern world<br /> Can apocalyptic forms reach dream\u2019s of the mortal? Personally, it\u2019s a big no no in my games.<br /> Can a demon create apocalyptic forms related to the wyrm?. You could take some cues from Freak Legion, sure\u2026 though if you meet a werewolf, well\u2026that\u2019s your problem .<br /> <br /> <br /> And now for something completely different.<br /> <br /> The Taboos of the Fallen.<br /> <br /> On my game theres \u201cTaboos.\u201d That demon\u2019s don\u2019t cross, no because they cant. But because they shoudnt. More than an strict line, see it as a guideline, these might be broken though.<br /> <br /> <u>One. Never mating in apocalyptic form or in true visage. </u><br /> <br /> <br /> One word. Nephilims.<br /> <u>Two. Demons shall not intervene in the world of man. </u><br /> <br /> Except for the most extremist ones, demons consider that mankind is already doomed by their own actions, so most of them try not to get involved with massive events such as wars, school shootings, serial killers etc..<br /> <u>Three. No summon angels. We are in this together now. We don\u2019t need God in here anymore.</u><br /> <u>Fourth: We are Alone in this Fight. What ever god has created its now our enemy. For they will try to harvest our power for their own goals. </u><br /> Fifth: All states, and countries should have at least one Fallen Reign leaded by its Tyrant, followed by an Infernal court.<br /> Sixth: only a Tyrant may allow the Invocation of any fallen ones on the Abyssm<br /> Seventh: Consuming some other brother\u2019s essence is forbidden<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T23:26:13-08:00","id":842428,"title":"","content":"I'll read the rest of the post when I'm not newly awoken, but I did pick up on the &quot;don't summon angels k;&quot; does that mean God and/or Heaven is an active force in your games?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-05T09:38:28-08:00","id":842611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karavolos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=842428#post842428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll read the rest of the post when I'm not newly awoken, but I did pick up on the &quot;don't summon angels k;&quot; does that mean God and/or Heaven is an active force in your games?</div> </div> </div> </div>In my games, God left the building. but Heaven is still occupied by Things.<br /> <br /> Can you Summon an angel on my games by remembering one of Those Who Didn't Fell From Grace's name?..yes....<br /> <br /> But if youre stupid enough to do it, i just grin and slowly pull the angel's stats from Time of Judgemenet","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T05:59:22-07:00","id":854432,"title":"","content":"I get a bit flooded by the quotes and amount of info, now that I'm finally getting off my slothful ass and reading it, but from what I gather your angels work a lot like nWoD Spirits with there being an angel for just about anything (including vengeance) who have &quot;dominion&quot; over whatever they represent. That said I like the system of it with the Dominion that you described and may borrow and mix around it a bit.<br /> I'm personally a bigger fan of the aesthetic of angels being winged humanoids rather than huge burning wheels or three-faced titans and the likes and tend to justify it with &quot;in the old days when god was around they could choose such forms, but after he left the Fallen lost that ability completely while Loyalists (as non-represented as they are in my game, save maybe brief glances for Obrimos Mages - I mix the WoD's) can at best do it briefly and very taxingly; likely causing them notable damage to be in the form for long akin to how an Earthbound breaks their mortal host, only with the Angel breaking itself instead, since it has a weak tie to God (if he/she/it even exist anymore) and little to no tie with Humanity unlike the Fallen who frequently gather cults or otherwise go out of their way to create Pacts in order to ensure a supply of Faith.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure about nephilims as a whole if I wanna involve the concept in my games or not; how do you play them?<br /> I also wonder if High-Torment Apocalyptic Form traits form over time rather than being chosen right away, does it mean your Fallen can't manifest High-Torment traits in turn for taking Temporary Torment like in the core game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T10:54:34-07:00","id":854554,"title":"","content":"Do they have any plans to make a 20th anniversary edition of this?","si