r day. There is an absolute minimum of 1 Imbued (including Bystanders) for every 6 million people if we take the global figure, and 1:1.3mil if we extrapolate from the disproportionate American weighting of the Imbued population. Those figures are far too low to reflect the actual game populations, but nonetheless form a bare minimum baseline that can be compared against other kinds and used as a benchmark for more representative populations. More useful is stuff like how many hunters are dead (15% or so) in the listing, how many are male or female (40% male, 18% male, with 42% unknown or ambiguous), etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Forgotthat theres demons in HtR, in fall from Grace as well.<br /> <br /> I got the Shadow of Lucifer book. I need to sit down and read it, ill help you in what ever way i can<br /> <br /> As for imbueds, would be neat to have a Status thing - Poster ( uf he has found Hunter net or not) And if is Alive or dead","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T00:24:53-08:00","id":1009662,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hello, I hope this is ok to post here. I am currently one of the active players in a Demon: The Fallen play by post game, and we are actively recruiting more players.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It is located here: <a href=\"http://creolesoulsfallen.forumotion.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://creolesoulsfallen.forumotion.com/</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br /> It has absolutely amazing writers/players who are pretty active so far, but we'd love to have more. If you're at all interested in actually playing Demon: The Fallen, I highly recommend it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br /> If you happen to head over there, tell them &quot;Rex Mercer&quot; sent you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> MagicRob would be the person to speak to about getting started, or let me (Rex Mercer) know, and I'll help you get set up and talking to the right people. We aren't super deep in, but things are just starting to go really well with a good amount of activity. New players are extremely welcome, and we can teach as much as necessary!<br /> <br /> Again, thanks for your time and attention to this, and I hope to see you there!</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12654-silentstillness","name":"SilentStillness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T02:01:48-08:00","id":1009692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=1003758#post1003758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[Demon statistics]<br /> It's actually just under 1 in 7, not over, but whatever. I'm lazy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there actually any reason why there's more Fallens in North America? (Other than the action taking place there.)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T02:27:44-08:00","id":1009697,"title":"","content":"There's one big reason that the disproportionate representation is actually warranted, and it's the big L himself. When Lucifer made his appearance, demons started flocking to LA, and then dispersed out to search for him following any lead they could get. Add in a few other sites of note to attract disproportionate attention - like Vejovis's Crater - and America is a hotspot. LA accounts for the vast majority of American entries though - 125 out of 162 American demons.<br /> <br /> This does mean that at its height, LA had 1 demon for every 30,000 mortals in addition to its vampires, garou, mages, and changelings. It's a crowded city if you count the entire oWoD as one setting. Add just some of the vampires alone and you go to a 10,000:1 supernatural ratio.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5307,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","user":"loomer","date":". 11-29-2016, 05:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T01:24:45-08:00","id":1010103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SilentStillness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=1009662#post1009662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hello, I hope this is ok to post here. I am currently one of the active players in a Demon: The Fallen play by post game, and we are actively recruiting more players.<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It is located here: <a href=\"http://creolesoulsfallen.forumotion.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://creolesoulsfallen.forumotion.com/</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br /> It has absolutely amazing writers/players who are pretty active so far, but we'd love to have more. If you're at all interested in actually playing Demon: The Fallen, I highly recommend it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br /> If you happen to head over there, tell them &quot;Rex Mercer&quot; sent you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> MagicRob would be the person to speak to about getting started, or let me (Rex Mercer) know, and I'll help you get set up and talking to the right people. We aren't super deep in, but things are just starting to go really well with a good amount of activity. New players are extremely welcome, and we can teach as much as necessary!<br /> <br /> Again, thanks for your time and attention to this, and I hope to see you there!</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Would love to but experience has shown that forum roleplaying is not for me. I usually start with great enthusiasm and nice posts but cant keep up the inspiration continually which means I stop again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11694-hexer","name":"Hexer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11694_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T14:37:37-08:00","id":1011670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=1010103#post1010103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Would love to but experience has shown that forum roleplaying is not for me. I usually start with great enthusiasm and nice posts but cant keep up the inspiration continually which means I stop again.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sadface.<br /> <br /> Maybe you just weren't playing an awesome fallen angel steeped in the void of hell...? lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12654-silentstillness","name":"SilentStillness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T04:47:14-08:00","id":1011947,"title":"","content":"Discalimer: I don't know much about Changeling.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkExcalibur42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/580091-demon-the-fallen-thread-for-is-better-to-rule-in-earth-than-serve-in-heaven?p=590888#post590888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The fae seem to be very much like angels in that they are beings of faith (glamour), though they were created out of humanity's dreams rather than the Creator's will. I don't think any of the existing Lores can really be directly related to them. They're something newer and different.</div> </div> </div> </div>Back on the Old Board, there used to be a theory... Some Nephilim escaped the purge. Not the most blatant and well-known ones, but the most subtle ones. Their birthright being both the powers of the Elohim and the potential and creativity of humanity, they too could build realms. Much like the Reapers built the Underworld. The most skilled, whose realms were the furtherst from Earth were the ones to survive. With their retainers and concubines, over the millennia, they populated the realms. Each generation further away from the Elohim. The last generations, with the most humanity in them, is the Fae.<br /> <br /> Glamour, under this theory, is basically faith. <br /> <br /> There were lots of theories about the Realms of the Nephilim too. Like, they suck up faith from humanity through the dreams of humanity. Thats is why the WoD is decaying, magic is vanishing, etc. God left the WoD in good working order. Or the Nephilim, after thousands of years reached their full potential and has God chained at the heart of a realm constructed for that purpose. Other notions include the idea Arcadia is only one realm, closer to dreams than most. Inanimae and Adhene are from different Realms. People have tied the notion of realms constructed by the Nephilim into some Umbral Realms, and some of the 1000 Hells or Far Shores.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-11T12:12:11-08:00","id":1015765,"title":"","content":"Hello, I have a question, does a Demon see a Changeling in it's fae form? Also, can a Demon be enchanted. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Reboot","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3684-david-g",